'''Team Plasma''' (Japanese: '''プラズマ団''' ''Team Plasma'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that first debuted in the [[Generation V]] games. This class comprises all the members of [[Team Plasma]] which battle the {{player}}, notably [[Ghetsis]] and the team's former leader [[N]] in his final three battles with the player in {{game|Black and White|s}}. In {{2v2|Black|White|2}}, the player again battles Ghetsis along with the high-ranking members [[Zinzolin]], the [[Shadow Triad]], and [[Colress]], the latter of which only uses this class during one battle before formally disbanding from the group. N, having renounced the team's ways, no longer uses this class. In {{g|Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon}}, the class is used exclusively by Ghetsis during his appearance in [[Episode RR]].
